{"title": "The flush below the lows", "type": "Big players", "hooks": ["Everyone's stop sat under these lows. Then price went and took them.", "It flushed every stop below the range. Then it ran the other way.", "This drop looked like the end. It was a stop hunt."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Everyone's stop sat under these lows. Then price went and took them.", "text": "Stops under the lows", "chart": 0, "win": [17, 112], "show": 87}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "A tidy range", "show": 44, "vo": "ServerSill Data Centers. For hours it bounced between about 271 and 284. Buyers in that range put their stops just under the lows.", "cues": [{"say": "between about 271 and 284", "do": "reveal", "to": 70}, {"say": "just under the lows", "do": "shade", "from": 45, "to": 70, "tone": "amber"}], "win": [17, 112]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The flush", "show": 70, "vo": "Then it dropped hard, all the way to 214.74. Every one of those stops was hit on the way down.", "cues": [{"say": "all the way to 214.74", "do": "reveal", "to": 77}, {"say": "Every one of those stops", "do": "mark", "i": 77, "label": "Low", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [17, 112]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "The other way", "show": 77, "vo": "Then it climbed back and closed through resistance at 264.7. Twenty-five candles later, it was 10.6 percent higher.", "cues": [{"say": "resistance at 264.7", "do": "line", "price": 264.7, "label": "Resistance", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "Twenty-five candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 112}], "win": [17, 112]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Stops go where the idea is wrong", "vo": "The lesson isn't to skip stops. Put them where the idea is wrong, and size the trade so a flush is survivable.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise with no real money", "vo": "Follow for more, and practise placing stops on real game charts at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Everyone's stop sat under these lows. Then p